---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title_cy="Busnesau a Grwpiau Lleol" title_en="Local Businesses and Groups">
  <div class="page-banner"><h1><span lang="cy">Busnesau a Grwpiau Lleol</span><span lang="en">Local Businesses &amp; Groups</span></h1></div>
  <div class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="/"><span lang="cy">Hafan</span><span lang="en">Home</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <a href="/llansannan/">Llansannan</a> &rsaquo;
    <span lang="cy">Busnesau &amp; Grwpiau</span><span lang="en">Businesses &amp; Groups</span>
  </div>
  <div class="site-wrap"><div class="content" data-pagefind-body>
    <h2 class="sh"><span lang="cy">Busnesau a Grwpiau Cymunedol</span><span lang="en">Businesses and Community Groups</span></h2><hr class="sh-rule">

    <p lang="cy">Mae ardal Llansannan yn gartref i amrywiaeth o fusnesau lleol a grwpiau cymunedol. Mae'r cyngor yn cefnogi economi leol ffyniannus a bywyd cymunedol bywiog.</p>
    <p lang="en">The Llansannan area is home to a variety of local businesses and community groups. The council supports a thriving local economy and vibrant community life.</p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Grwpiau Cymunedol</span><span lang="en">Community Groups</span></h3>
    <div class="minutes-list">
      <div class="minutes-item">
        <div>
          <strong><span lang="cy">Neuadd Bentref Llansannan</span><span lang="en">Llansannan Village Hall</span></strong>
          <div class="fg-meta"><span lang="cy">Lleoliad digwyddiadau cymunedol</span><span lang="en">Community events venue</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="minutes-item">
        <div>
          <strong><span lang="cy">Clwb Ffermwyr Ifanc</span><span lang="en">Young Farmers' Club</span></strong>
          <div class="fg-meta"><span lang="cy">Gweithgareddau ieuenctid amaethyddol</span><span lang="en">Agricultural youth activities</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="sub-sh" style="margin-top:2rem"><span lang="cy">Busnesau Lleol</span><span lang="en">Local Businesses</span></h3>

    <div class="upload-note">
      <p lang="cy">I gael eich busnes neu grŵp wedi'i restru yma, cysylltwch â <a href="/contact/">y Clerc</a>. Mae'r gwasanaeth hwn am ddim i fusnesau ac sefydliadau yn ardal Cyngor Cymuned Llansannan.</p>
      <p lang="en">To have your business or group listed here, <a href="/contact/">contact the Clerk</a>. This service is free to businesses and organisations in the Llansannan Community Council area.</p>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href="/the-council/grants/"><span lang="cy">Grantiau ar gyfer grwpiau cymunedol →</span><span lang="en">Grants for community groups →</span></a></p>
  </div></div>
</Layout>
